{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"611","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. New Year and Old Property"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The year 2015 is almost over."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Limak is a little polar bear. He has recently learnt about the binary system. He noticed that the passing year has exactly one zero in its representation in the binary system — "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"201510 = 111110111112"},{"kind":"text","text":". Note that he doesn't care about the number of zeros in the decimal representation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Limak chose some interval of years. He is going to count all years from this interval that have exactly one zero in the binary representation. Can you do it faster?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Assume that all positive integers are always written without leading zeros."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of the input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ a ≤ b ≤ 1018"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the first year and the last year in Limak's interval respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer – the number of years Limak will count in his chosen interval."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2015 2015\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"100 105\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"72057594000000000 72057595000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"26\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample Limak's interval contains numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"510 = 1012"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"610 = 1102"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"710 = 1112"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"810 = 10002"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"910 = 10012"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1010 = 10102"},{"kind":"text","text":". Two of them ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1012"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1102"},{"kind":"text","text":") have the described property."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"611B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/611/problem/B"}